    "title": "3 Boyut Üzerine",
    "titleEn": "On 3 Dimensions",
    "subtitle": "İnsancı İlke, İzomerler, Bertrand Teoremi ve Lorenz Çekicisi",
    "subtitleEn": "Anthropic Principle, Isomers, Bertrand's Theorem, and Lorenz Attractor",
